# RAM-only: inspect five live source traces, scroll, edit the focused rate,
# bypass/restore it, then return to Macros. No source creation or SD writes.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
20 assert_view MACRO
100 transport start
180 button LEFT_TOP down
300 encoder_value NAV 0.010
450 encoder_value NAV 0.010
650 button LEFT_TOP up
1100 assert_mode project.modulators
1200 marker registry_live
2500 encoder_value NAV 0.010
2800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
3100 encoder_value NAV -0.010
3400 encoder_value OPT 0.250
3700 encoder_value OPT 0.750
4100 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
4400 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
4700 assert_mode project.modulators
4800 marker registry_edited
5400 button LEFT_TOP down
5550 encoder_value NAV -0.010
5700 encoder_value NAV -0.010
5900 button LEFT_TOP up
6300 assert_view MACRO
# Keep performing after leaving: hidden registry work must not follow us.
6500 marker macro_return
9500 transport stop
9700 marker done
